Package: secubox-mcp-server
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, secubox-core (>= 1.0.0)
Description: SecuBox MCP Server — Model Context Protocol server for AI tools
 Hosts a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server exposing SecuBox
 telemetry, config, and operations to MCP-compatible AI clients
 (Claude Desktop, Cursor, etc.). Operator-controlled tool surface
 with per-client authentication.
 .
 Distinct from sibling packages in the AI cluster:
  - secubox-ai-gateway — request router with sovereignty policy.
  - secubox-ai-insights — ML-based threat detection.
  - secubox-localai — self-hosted LocalAI LLM runtime.
  - secubox-ollama — Ollama LLM runtime wrapper.
